<title>USA: MBIA says has capacity for First USA Bank bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA says has capacity for First USA Bank bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it qualified a limited supply of secondary market insurance capacity for First USA Bank.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to $10 million per firm.</p>
<p>Only First USA bonds which mature within two years qualify, MBIA said.</p>
<p>Capacity is available on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
</text>
